# CI-generated, never committed. Trivy's vulnerability DB is a GitLab cache path and the
# JUnit files are artifacts, but both are written into the project directory, so a local
# `trivy fs .` or `pytest --junitxml` would otherwise show up as untracked noise.
.trivycache/
runtime-requirements.txt
junit-*.xml
trivy-*.json
.uv-cache/

