# Technology evaluation, internal working notes
capacitor_viability.md

# ── The session scaffolding, ignored so `git add -A` cannot commit it ─────────
#
# `plan.md` and `session/` are working notes for one wave. Both are on the DENY
# list in `ci/make-public-tree.sh`, which keeps them out of the published tree,
# and that is a **publish time** backstop rather than a commit time one: it says
# nothing about what reaches `main`.
#
# **Twice now a bare `git add -A` has swept the wave plan into a merge**, once
# corrected by a commit whose subject says exactly that, and once by the session
# that wrote this. A rule nobody remembers at the moment they type the command is
# not a rule, so it is enforced here instead of stated anywhere.
plan.md
session/
